      <article class="ar-card ar-company-card" id="ar-company">
        <div class="ar-card-heading">
          <span>01 / THE COMPANY</span>
          <span class="ar-card-dot"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="ar-company-symbol">A.</div>

        <div class="ar-company-copy">
          <h3>Beyond<br>the blueprint.</h3>
          <p>
            Arshana Project Private Limited focuses on gas
            pipeline engineering and infrastructure solutions.
            We bring together technical understanding,
            coordinated planning and a practical approach
