          </p>
          <a href="/services">EXPLORE CAPABILITIES <span>↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- PURPOSE CARD -->
      <article class="ar-card ar-purpose-card" id="ar-purpose">
        <div class="ar-card-heading">
          <span>02 / OUR PURPOSE</span>
          <span>✳</span>
        </div>

        <div class="ar-purpose-content">
          <span class="ar-mini-label">WHAT DRIVES US</span>
