          <p>Every project deserves clarity, coordination and care.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="ar-card-number">A — 02</span>
      </article>

      <!-- APPROACH CARD -->
      <article class="ar-card ar-approach-card" id="ar-approach">
        <div class="ar-card-heading">
          <span>03 / OUR APPROACH</span>
          <span>↗</span>
        </div>

        <div class="ar-approach-art">
          <div class="ar-orbit orbit-one"></div>
          <div class="ar-orbit orbit-two"></div>
          <div class="ar-orbit orbit-three"></div>
          <span>A.</span>
        </div>

        <h3>Thoughtful at every stage.</h3>
        <p>Planning. Coordination. Execution.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- VALUES CARD -->
      <article class="ar-card ar-values-card" id="ar-values">
        <div class="ar-card-heading">
          <span>04 / WHAT GUIDES US</span>
          <span>OUR VALUES</span>
        </div>

        <div class="ar-values-list">
          <div><span>01</span><strong>Technical focus</strong><b>↗</b></div>
          <div><span>02</span><strong>Quality mindset</strong><b>↗</b></div>
          <div><span>03</span><strong>Coordinated effort</strong><b>↗</b></div>
          <div><span>04</span><strong>Responsible execution</strong><b>↗</b></div>
